<item><title>Togo beats Algeria 3-0 in 2027 Africa Cup qualifying</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-beats-algeria-3-0-in-2027-africa-cup-qualifying-6372f2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-beats-algeria-3-0-in-2027-africa-cup-qualifying-6372f2/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The Eagles scored in the 18th minute and secured the win at Kégué Stadium on Tuesday, 17 November.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:03:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo orders more road checks on main routes and in towns</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-orders-more-road-checks-on-main-routes-and-in-towns-ea6716/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-orders-more-road-checks-on-main-routes-and-in-towns-ea6716/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The Security Ministry says the operations will target all vehicle types and offences including speeding, dangerous overtaking and driving without a valid licence.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:24:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo adds Ewe and Kabye as optional BAC II subjects from June 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-adds-ewe-and-kabye-as-optional-bac-ii-subjects-from-706a08/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-adds-ewe-and-kabye-as-optional-bac-ii-subjects-from-706a08/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The Baccalaureate Office says candidates can choose either national language, bringing the number of optional language subjects to seven.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:47:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-adds-ewe-and-kabye-as-optional-bac-ii-subjects-from-706a08/share.jpg" length="42969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-adds-ewe-and-kabye-as-optional-bac-ii-subjects-from-706a08/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
